ty":"宋"}},{"title":"道傍菊有感","author":"赵蕃","text":"昔日曾升君子堂，祇今萧艾与俱长。\n可怜冷蝶无时态，尽日伶俜为汝忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":48046,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道傍落梅","author":"赵蕃","text":"一树梅花古道边，随风堕落自年年。\n情知所遇合如此，未必春风独尔偏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":48047,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹅湖道中二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"人间那有万株松，莫道名山都未逢。\n自拄枯藜行不倦，更听斋后几声钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":48048,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹅湖道中二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"两道苍松列翠幢，雨来浑似度桐江。\n恨无东绢堪图此，归伴蒲团挂北窗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":48049,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹅湖道中呈斯远","author":"赵蕃","text":"翠阜奔腾似列屯，老松错落更横陈。\n风高日暖鹅湖路，宜此萧然两幅巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":48050,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"微雨三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"云深不见山，雨密还遮树。\n相见说相思，相思说何处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":48051,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"微雨三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"大雨若盆倾，小雨如丝乱。\n盆覆几时收，丝长何日断。